					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1560" height="631" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Black Friday 2026 Points Promotion Offer Sale Landing Page" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page.jpg 1560w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-300x121.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-1024x414.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-768x311.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-1536x621.jpg 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 1560px) 100vw, 1560px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>The annual Black Friday 2026 Sale will be coming soon at LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia). This epic sale event will</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-store-black-friday-2026-rewards-center-insiders-points-offer-promotion-revealed/">LEGO Store Black Friday 2026: Rewards Center Insiders Points Offer Promotion Revealed</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114988 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sale-Toy-Set-Deals-Banner-Logo-Landing-Page.jpg" alt="" width="1417" height="573" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sale-Toy-Set-Deals-Banner-Logo-Landing-Page.jpg 1578w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sale-Toy-Set-Deals-Banner-Logo-Landing-Page-300x121.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sale-Toy-Set-Deals-Banner-Logo-Landing-Page-1024x414.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sale-Toy-Set-Deals-Banner-Logo-Landing-Page-768x311.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sale-Toy-Set-Deals-Banner-Logo-Landing-Page-1536x621.jpg 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 1417px) 100vw, 1417px" /></p>
<p>The annual Black Friday 2026 Sale will be coming soon at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). This epic sale event will run from Black Friday, November 27, 2026 to Cyber Monday, November 30, 2026.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114989 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale.jpg" alt="" width="310" height="566" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale.jpg 310w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-164x300.jpg 164w" sizes="(max-width: 310px) 100vw, 310px" /></p>
<p>We now know that one of the rewards promotion will be where you can get 500 Insider Reward Points for only 100 Insider Reward Points redemption! Note that different countries may offer slightly different variation of points/value of the points. This loyalty points promotional offer starts on November 27, 2026 at 0:00 EST and will run until November 30, 2026. I know the picture on the LEGO Insiders Rewards Center (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>) shows the date with coming soon on November 26, 2026. However, the fine print on the reward item page shows that it starts on November 27, 2026.</p>
<p>There is a limit of one code per member. In addition, there are only limited number of this points offer so they&#8217;re only while supplies last (first come first serve basis). In past years, these Insider Points or Discount Vouchers usually sell out fast and don&#8217;t last for the whole promo period.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Promotional Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114987 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page.jpg" alt="" width="1451" height="587" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page.jpg 1560w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-300x121.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-1024x414.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-768x311.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Points-Promotion-Offer-Sale-Landing-Page-1536x621.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1451px) 100vw, 1451px" /></p>
<p>Although we don&#8217;t know much about what will be on sale for Black Friday 2026, the gift with purchases will probably be the same as what is being offered for LEGO Insiders Weekend which we wrote in an earlier article <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-insiders-weekend-promotions-revealed-double-points-gwp-gift-with-purchases-sale-november-21-22-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over here</a>. In past years, LEGO offers the same GWP Gift with Purchases for Insiders Weekend and Black Friday.</p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when the LEGO Store Black Friday 2026 Sale goes live!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><!--StartFragment --></p>
<p><!--EndFragment --></p>
<p>For the most up to date current LEGO promotions, offers and gift with purchase (GWP) being offered, check the official LEGO store promotional pages links below.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>US United States</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Canada</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>UK United Kingdom</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Australia</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103542 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg" alt="" width="909" height="459" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg 909w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-300x151.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-768x388.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 909px) 100vw, 909px" /></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are <span style="text-decoration: underline;">no ads</span> in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="690" height="551" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 690px) 100vw, 690px" /></p>
