		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114974</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="887" height="885" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGOLAND California Theme Park Resort Black Friday Up to 50% off Tickets, Hotel Stays and Annual Passes Banner Logo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo.jpg 887w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Theme-Park-Resort-Black-Friday-Up-to-50-off-Tickets-Hotel-Stays-and-Annual-Passes-Banner-Logo-768x766.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px" /></p>
<p>LEGOLAND Theme Park Resorts (California &#124; Florida &#124; New York) have many amusement park rides and attractions. They</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/black-friday-2026-sale-now-live-for-legoland-usa-theme-parks-up-to-50-60-off-hotel-package-tickets-more-california-florida-new-york/">Black Friday 2026 Sale Now Live for LEGOLAND USA Theme Parks: Up to 50-60% off Hotel Package, Tickets &#038; More (California, Florida &#038; New York)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102219 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLAND-New-York-Black-Friday-2025-Deals-700x339-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="700" height="339" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLAND-New-York-Black-Friday-2025-Deals-700x339-Banner-Logo.jpg 700w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLAND-New-York-Black-Friday-2025-Deals-700x339-Banner-Logo-300x145.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></p>
<p>LEGOLAND Theme Park Resorts (<a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York</a>) have many amusement park rides and attractions. They are a great place to take your family and little ones for a fun vacation or getaway. (=</p>
<p>The annual Black Friday 2026 Sale is now live and officially here at all three LEGOLAND Theme Park Resorts (<a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York</a>). This is one of the best times of the year to secure and book hotel stays and ticket package bundles, buy annual passes or general admission tickets. We&#8217;ll go over all the deals in this article!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><em>Shown below are some of the rooms from the <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> Castle Hotel.</em></p>
