<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-110276 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-43029-Olivia-Rodrigos-Concert-Moon-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="1044" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-43029-Olivia-Rodrigos-Concert-Moon-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1044w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-43029-Olivia-Rodrigos-Concert-Moon-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-261x300.png 261w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-43029-Olivia-Rodrigos-Concert-Moon-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-891x1024.png 891w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-43029-Olivia-Rodrigos-Concert-Moon-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x883.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-43029-Olivia-Rodrigos-Concert-Moon-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x1177.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1044px) 100vw, 1044px" /></p>
