<p>Some of my favorites include the Japanese Red Maple Bonsai Tree for its vibrant colors and design, as well as the Going Merry Pirate Ship for its detail and the beautiful interior spaces it contains. I also love the Ferris Wheel set, as it not only lets you create a Ferris Wheel but also a UFO ride and a spinning carousel for even more fun and creativity.</p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
