<p>Target US LEGO November 2026 Deals continue. They now have LEGO Star Wars: The Clone Wars Battle of</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-lego-november-2026-deals-continue-retiring-soon-star-wars-battle-of-felucia-separatist-mtt-20-off-toy-story-lotso-40-off-more/">[US] Target LEGO November 2026 Deals Continue: Retiring Soon Star Wars Battle of Felucia Separatist MTT (20% off), Toy Story Lotso (40% off) &#038; More</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
