										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114881 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="846" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box.webp 846w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-212x300.webp 212w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-722x1024.webp 722w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-768x1089.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 846px) 100vw, 846px" /></p>
<p>An upcoming LEGO November 2026 Insiders Weekend GWP Gift with Purchase has been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Release Dates, promotional period and how to get for 40914 Retro Jukebox GWP would all be looked at in this article!</p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when 40914 Retro Jukebox GWP promotion becomes available!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<ul>
<li>40914 Retro Jukebox GWP November 2026 Insiders Weekend</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114889 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Lifestyle-4.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Lifestyle-4.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Lifestyle-4-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Lifestyle-4-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Lifestyle-4-768x512.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><!--StartFragment --></p>
<p><!--EndFragment --></p>
<h3>LEGO 40914 Retro Jukebox GWP Set Revealed: Release Dates, Promo Period &amp; Release Dates</h3>
<h3>40914 Retro Jukebox GWP November 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>Retail Price: N/A</li>
<li>Recommended Age: 18+</li>
<li>Number of Pieces: 287</li>
<li>Official Release Date: November 21, 2026</li>
<li>Promo Period: November 21-22, 2026 (Insiders Weekend)</li>
<li>Promo Offer (Insiders Only): Free with LEGO Purchases over $250 USD / $325 CAD / £225 GBP / $410 AUD</li>
